        }
      ],
      "unknowns": []
    },
    {
      "id": "L03_CURRENT_ORDINARY_LEVEL",
      "status": "VERIFIED",
      "conclusion": "For the ordinary branch: affixReq=clamp(-10+sum(L(storedTier))+2*L(maxStoredTier, default0),1,90) over contributing existing affixes. Item requirement=max(base levelRequirement,affixReq,1). The 90 cap applies to the affix expression, not the base level.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "method": "currentAffixLevel",
          "sites": [
            "0x120e527-0x120e604",
            "0x120e64f-0x120e6dc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "method": "levelAndClass",
          "sites": [
            "0x11f99c2-0x11f9aba"
          ]
        },
        {
          "method": "currentLevel",
          "sites": [
            "0x120f700-0x120f724"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": []
    },
    {
      "id": "L04_AFTER_SHARD",
      "status": "VERIFIED",
      "conclusion": "AfterShard first finds an existing matching ID that is Standard0 and unsealed0; the separate closure imposes all three conditions. A qualifying existing targetStoredTier=oldStoredTier+tiersToAdd; otherwise targetStoredTier=0 regardless of tiersToAdd, including same-ID experimental/sealed objects. It delegates to WithAffixAtTier and is not a complete eligibility validator.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "method": "afterShard",
          "sites": [
            "0x11f9e46-0x11f9e78"
          ]
        },
        {
          "method": "afterShardPredicate",
          "sites": [
            "0x1231709-0x123172a"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": []
    },
    {
      "id": "L05_HYPOTHETICAL_LEVEL",
      "status": "VERIFIED",
      "conclusion": "WithAffixAtTier always includes the hypothetical target contribution; excludes every existing matching ID and then filters other affixes by CanContribute. It caps the hypothetical affix sum at90, then takes max(baseReq,thatSum,1). Inputs are stored tier indexes. Full tail and switch tables were audited beyond the truncated metadata descriptor.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "method": "withAffix",
          "sites": [
            "0x11f9f43-0x11fa00f",
            "0x11fa09d-0x11fa0f9",
            "0x11fa164-0x11fa27e"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": []
    },
    {
      "id": "L06_MAX_TIER_HELPER",
      "status": "VERIFIED",
      "conclusion": "GetMaxAffixTierForLevel tests stored6 down to1, returns the first whose hypothetical requirement fits. Otherwise returns0 without checking T1. It never returns stored7/T8; returned0 alone cannot authorize T1.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "method": "maxTierForLevel",
          "sites": [
            "0x1202491-0x12024cf"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": []
    },
