      "id": "L09_GLYPHS_ON_NEW_ID",
      "status": "VERIFIED",
      "conclusion": "Chaos/Order/Despair are not a blanket capability rejection on an absent target ID. In the ordinary shard path, Forge only enables Chaos/Order for an existing nonsealed matching ID and Despair for an existing ID with no ordinary sealed slot. A new ID is added atT1 without these glyph effects, and their active/consume flag staysfalse. Despair with an existing ordinary sealed slot is rejected by capability even if shard target is absent. Rune11-related flags are outside this claim scope.",
      "evidence": [
        {
