    {
      "id": "L10_ROLL_AND_LIST_ORDER",
      "status": "VERIFIED",
      "conclusion": "Ordinary primary upgrades reroll roll byte unless preserveRollWithinTier=true. Only effective Order sets that flag in the audited glyph path; the same flag reaches ExtraAffixTier. The dedicated primary extra-tier branch respects it; fallback extra-tier selection always rerolls, even if it selects the primary ID. Successful SealAffix preserves tier and roll, removes the selected object then prepends it, and marks sealedType1/regular occupancy. Failed Despair upgrades first and rerolls, before full outer critical/refund settlement.",
